#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-02-000006.md:10
msgid "学習前に必要なすべての顔領域にコントローラーを割り当ててください。"
msgstr "Assign controllers to every required facial region before training."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-02-000006.md:12
msgid "原因"
msgstr "Why this happens"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-02-000006.md:14
msgid "必要なUpper、Eyelid、Gaze、Lowerのうち、コントローラーがない領域があります。"
msgstr ""
"At least one of the required Upper, Eyelid, Gaze and Lower groups has no "
"controller."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-02-000006.md:16
msgid "対処方法"
msgstr "How to resolve it"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-02-000006.md:18
msgid ""
"Controller "
"Settingsで必要な各顔領域に1つ以上のコントローラーを割り当て、表を保存してから再実行してください。すべてを1つの領域に割り当てても、他の領域は満たされません。"
msgstr ""
"Assign at least one controller to each required facial region in "
"Controller Settings, save the table, then retry. Assigning every "
"controller to one region does not fill the other groups."

